(a) Dimensional drawings in triplicate in sufficient detail to permit identification of the type;
(b) A brief description giving the technical specifications of the materials constituting the advance warning
triangle and instructions for use;
(c) A copy of the instructions on its assembly for use;
(d) Samples of the retro-reflective and of the fluorescent areas; the number of samples to be submitted is specified
in paragraph 5.9.
